@display("std/project")
project: component(path = "std/project", lang = "heron") {
  | The implementation side of a spec that lives apart from its code: the declaration that a
  | tree implements a spec at a version, the proofs that link the spec's requirements to the
  | tests that prove them, where the rest stands, and the releases.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/project/package.heron`, whose types the API reference renders.
  | `implements` and `release` are specified in [Specs and implementations](#language.specifications.implementations), and `proves`, `verify`, `status`, `<planned>` and `<untested>` in [Verify, status and coverage](#language.specifications.traceability).

  uses = [language.std.doc, language.std.spec, language.std.tech]
}
